ort for offline players.", "created_at": "2015-05-22T23:36:26Z", "repo": "EconomySim", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2f80aaf75d60a201c2dbcb938e7782c583029098", "message": "Improved price learning algorithm. Implemented transaction amount decay for price stability, especially in small economies. Implemented timed saving. Moved world config from worlds.yml to config.yml. Per-worldgroup config is now used. Improved messages.", "created_at": "2015-05-22T20:35:57Z", "repo": "EconomySim", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "999106fc8697281770f97753d634c8eac0ff7833", "message": "Initial code commit.", "created_at": "2015-05-21T22:50:22Z", "repo": "EconomySim", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ae88a9715ba4387c8b0c5fd032f062d377831800", "message": "Initializing repo", "created_at": "2015-05-21T16:53:56Z", "repo": "EconomySim", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5899ec20819572e14fe8df66a3f2691547f681d3", "message": "Added plugin metrics. Changed plugin version.", "created_at": "2015-06-05T01:20:03Z", "repo": "CustomHardcore", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3745aa04d6b64338b027c3e721998617ab4ef125", "message": "Updated readme.", "created_at": "2015-05-30T21:44:40Z", "repo": "CustomHardcore", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f0eeaa3702655a08c57c6ada18a6a6ea77c5581c", "message": "Updated readme.", "created_at": "2015-05-30T19:10:54Z", "repo": "CustomHardcore", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6628b5ae040448ca2c51e4d87851dcb85cb76c10", "message": "Merge branch 'master' of https://github.com/Beskhue/CustomHardcore", "created_at": "2015-05-29T20:26:26Z", "repo": "CustomHardcore", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "acab6b2f8b70d5582c6b2b0e94059e35f5a826e0", "message": "Improved hard-coded default values. Cleaned the default config. Fixed issue where number casts threw exceptions when doubles were expected but integers were set in the config. Fixed issue where the banishment location could not be read from the hard-coded default values.", "created_at": "2015-05-29T20:17:46Z", "repo": "CustomHardcore", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4144d19308252d6649506c651a0af79901e6f34f", "message": "Implemented configuration reloading.", "created_at": "2015-05-29T19:46:59Z", "repo": "CustomHardcore", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "76364d6f1edc920afeb25859031dd8db45c49d69", "message": "Changed version to 1.1. Implemented life regeneration options. Implemented hard-coded default values.", "created_at": "2015-05-27T02:49:31Z", "repo": "CustomHardcore", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "552feac811210314d97da667c4fe35f2c35bcce1", "message": "Default values no longer have to be explicitly set in the config.yml for the default group. If both a group and the default group don't have a configuration value set, the hardcoded value in the Default class will be used.", "created_at": "2015-05-27T00:16:08Z", "repo": "CustomHardcore", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "dc6e57b09620be5a4d809b7a3be3fb601147876a", "message": "Multiverse-Core now no longer has to be supplied with the jar for the plugin to work on servers without Multiverse-Core installed. Improved readme.", "created_at": "2015-05-25T20:09:34Z", "repo": "CustomHardcore", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "77327ae2fe5eb73c34e2bb395897286c7acba776", "message": "Improved Readme.", "created_at": "2015-05-25T02:38:17Z", "repo": "CustomHardcore", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3233862aa